<title>FRANCE: Algeria seeks 100,000 T US/Canadian durum -traders.</title>
<headline>Algeria seeks 100,000 T US/Canadian durum -traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria has launched a tender for the import of 100,000 tonnes of U.S. and/or Canadian durum wheat for shipment in December, European grain traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The results of the tender, launched October 7, are expected later this week, they said.</p>
<p>Algeria is seeking 50,000 tonnes of durum wheat for shipment in the first half of December and another 50,000 tonnes for shipment in the second half of December.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
